# PrefMem publication experiment suite design

This is the stable in-directory entry point required by the experiment
workflow. The single normative design is the repository-root
[EXPERIMENT_SUITE_DESIGN.md](../EXPERIMENT_SUITE_DESIGN.md). It is not copied
here because two editable copies could silently diverge before protocol freeze.

At the 2026-08-11 documentation audit, the normative file had 1,510 lines and
SHA-256
`55f0905f06ebbf3bd2cb8955cd0a8030e1990e6c7a63d9ed5e355435cb00b0d4`.
That value is an audit aid, not a substitute for the hash recorded by a future
campaign manifest. Freeze and live-source verification must recompute the file
digest from the exact bytes used for that campaign.

The design status is **proposed**, not frozen or approved. The implementation
source remains authoritative about present behavior. Any scientific narrowing
or change to the design must be explicit in the dated preregistration and the
[requirements crosswalk](REQUIREMENTS_CROSSWALK.md); an absent implementation
must never be treated as an implicit protocol amendment.
